---
title: Actions
description: All built-in actions grouped by category
category: basics
position: 1
markdownify: false
---

<p>
  All of Attractive.js's built-in actions.
</p>

<ul class="no-content actions-list">
  <% Content::Action.all.in_order_of(:group, Content::Action::GROUPS).group_by { it.group }.each do |group, actions| %>
    <li class="group">
      <h2><%= group %></h2>

      <ul class="actions">
        <%= render actions %>
      </ul>
    </li>
  <% end%>
</ul>
